function samplerChanged(){const p=currentSamplingProfile();updateSamplerBadges();if(p.locked){$('sampler').value='auto';$('scheduler').value='auto';$('status').textContent=`${p.label} 的 ${p.sampler} / ${p.scheduler} 已锁定。`;return}if($('sampler').value==='auto'&&$('scheduler').value==='auto')$('status').textContent=`已恢复 ${p.label} 自动推荐：${p.sampler} / ${p.scheduler}。`;else $('status').textContent=`已手动覆盖：${$('sampler').value==='auto'?p.sampler:$('sampler').value} + ${$('scheduler').value==='auto'?p.scheduler:$('scheduler').value}。`;promptEditorChanged()}
function updateSamplerBadges(){if(!$('samplerBadge')||!$('schedulerBadge'))return;const p=currentSamplingProfile();$('samplerBadge').textContent=$('sampler').value&&$('sampler').value!=='auto'?$('sampler').value:p.sampler;$('schedulerBadge').textContent=$('scheduler').value&&$('scheduler').value!=='auto'?$('scheduler').value:p.scheduler}
function sagChanged(){if($('sagEnabled').value==='on'){$('status').textContent='SAG 已开启：将在 LoRA 之后、K 采样前注入自注意力引导（缩放 '+$('sagScale').value+' / 模糊 '+$('sagBlur').value+'）。'}else{$('status').textContent='SAG 已关闭。'}}
function guidanceChanged(silent=false){let mode=$('guidanceMode').value;const p=currentSamplingProfile(),regional=$('regionsEnabled')?.checked;if((regional||!p.guidance_supported)&&mode!=='off'){$('guidanceMode').value='off';mode='off';if(!silent)$('status').textContent=regional?'多人分区已自动关闭 SAG/PAG，避免 Hook 重复计算和人物特征冲突。':`${p.label} 不支持 SAG/PAG。`}$('sagScaleWrap').style.display=mode==='sag'?'':'none';$('sagBlurWrap').style.display=mode==='sag'?'':'none';$('pagScaleWrap').style.display=mode==='pag'?'':'none';if(mode==='sag')$('status').textContent='SAG 已真实接入模型：缩放 '+$('sagScale').value+' / 模糊 '+$('sagBlur').value+'；会增加生成时间。';else if(mode==='pag')$('status').textContent='PAG 已真实接入模型：强度 '+$('pagScale').value+'，建议 1.5–2.0；会增加生成时间。';else if(!silent)$('status').textContent='注意力引导已关闭。'}
let regions=[];
function regionPresetValues(preset){const map={left:[0,0,0.54,1],right:[0.46,0,0.54,1],top:[0,0,1,0.54],bottom:[0,0.46,1,0.54]};return map[preset]||null}
function newRegion(index=0){return{name:'',prompt:'',subject:'1girl',lora:selectedLoraPayload()[index]?.name||'',preset:'custom',x:0,y:0,width:1,height:1,strength:1}}
function autoLayoutRegions(){const n=regions.length;if(!n)return;let boxes;if(n===1)boxes=[[0,0,1,1]];else if(n===2)boxes=[[0,0,.54,1],[.46,0,.54,1]];else if(n===3)boxes=[[0,0,.373,1],[.293,0,.414,1],[.627,0,.373,1]];else{const cols=Math.ceil(Math.sqrt(n)),rows=Math.ceil(n/cols);boxes=regions.map((_,i)=>[(i%cols)/cols,Math.floor(i/cols)/rows,1/cols,1/rows])}regions.forEach((r,i)=>{const b=boxes[i];r.x=b[0];r.y=b[1];r.width=b[2];r.height=b[3];r.preset=n===2?(i===0?'left':'right'):'custom'})}
function quickTwoRegions(){regions=[newRegion(0),newRegion(1)];autoLayoutRegions();renderRegions()}
function addRegion(){regions.push(newRegion(regions.length));autoLayoutRegions();renderRegions()}
function removeRegion(i){regions.splice(i,1);autoLayoutRegions();renderRegions()}
function regionField(i,field,val){if(!regions[i])return;regions[i][field]=['name','prompt','subject','lora'].includes(field)?val:Number(val);updateRegionWarnings()}
function regionPresetChanged(i){const sel=$('regionPreset'+i);if(sel)regions[i].preset=sel.value;const p=regionPresetValues(regions[i].preset);if(p){regions[i].x=p[0];regions[i].y=p[1];regions[i].width=p[2];regions[i].height=p[3]}renderRegions()}
function regionLoraOptions(current=''){const names=selectedLoraPayload().map(x=>x.name),all=current&&!names.includes(current)?[current,...names]:names;return'<option value="">不绑定（仅文本分区）</option>'+all.map(name=>`<option value="${esc(name)}"${name===current?' selected':''}>${esc(name)}${!names.includes(name)?'（已移除）':''}</option>`).join('')}
function regionWarnings(){if(!$('regionsEnabled')||!$('regionsEnabled').checked||!regions.length)return[];const ws=[];const[width,height]=$('size').value.split('x').map(Number),portrait=height>width,minSide=Math.min(width,height);if(regions.length<2)ws.push('只有一个角色区域；多人分区至少应创建两个角色。');regions.forEach((r,i)=>{const label=r.name?('「'+r.name+'」'):('角色 '+(i+1)),narrow=(r.width<=.55&&r.height>=.9)&&(r.x<.15||r.x+r.width>.85);if(!String(r.prompt||'').trim())ws.push(label+'尚未填写专属提示词。');if(portrait&&narrow)ws.push('竖版下左右布局，'+label+'区域过窄；建议横版 1216×832 或改上下布局。');if(Number(r.strength)<.75)ws.push(label+'区域强度过低，容易被全局提示覆盖；建议 0.9–1.15。');if(Number(r.strength)>1.5)ws.push(label+'区域强度过高，容易出现硬边和肢体变形；建议 0.9–1.15。');for(let j=i+1;j<regions.length;j++){const b=regions[j],ow=Math.max(0,Math.min(r.x+r.width,b.x+b.width)-Math.max(r.x,b.x)),oh=Math.max(0,Math.min(r.y+r.height,b.y+b.height)-Math.max(r.y,b.y)),overlap=ow*oh,smaller=Math.min(r.width*r.height,b.width*b.height);if(smaller&&overlap/smaller>.35)ws.push(`角色 ${i+1} 与角色 ${j+1} 重叠过大；柔边只需要约 10%–20%。`)}});const bound=regions.map(r=>r.lora).filter(Boolean);if(selectedLoraPayload().length>1&&!bound.length)ws.push('当前选择了多个 LoRA，但没有绑定到角色区域；角色 LoRA 会全局叠加，仍可能融合。');if(new Set(bound).size<bound.length)ws.push('同一个角色 LoRA 被绑定到多个区域，请确认这不是误选。');if(minSide<768)ws.push('当前多人尺寸偏小，建议长边 ≥1024（如 1216×832）。');return[...new Set(ws)]}
function updateRegionWarnings(){const ws=regionWarnings();regions.forEach((r,i)=>{const w=$('regionWarn'+i);if(w){const label=r.name?('「'+r.name+'」'):('角色 '+(i+1));w.textContent=ws.filter(x=>x.includes(label)||x.includes('角色 '+(i+1))||x.includes('尺寸')||x.includes('LoRA')).join(' ')}})}
function renderRegions(){const box=$('regionsList');if(!box)return;if(!regions.length){box.innerHTML='<span class="small">未添加角色：点下方“左右双人”快速创建。</span>';return}box.innerHTML=regions.map((r,i)=>`<div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px;margin-bottom:6px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><b>角色 ${i+1}</b><button class="secondary" type="button" onclick="removeRegion(${i})">删除</button></div><input id="regionName${i}" placeholder="角色名（可选，仅备注）" value="${esc(r.name)}" oninput="regionField(${i},'name',this.value)"><div class="two"><div><div class="field-title"><span>人物类型</span></div><select onchange="regionField(${i},'subject',this.value)"><option value="1girl"${r.subject==='1girl'?' selected':''}>1girl</option><option value="1boy"${r.subject==='1boy'?' selected':''}>1boy</option><option value="person"${r.subject==='person'?' selected':''}>person</option><option value="1other"${r.subject==='1other'?' selected':''}>1other</option></select></div><div><div class="field-title"><span>绑定角色 LoRA</span></div><select onchange="regionField(${i},'lora',this.value)">${regionLoraOptions(r.lora)}</select></div></div><textarea id="regionPrompt${i}" rows="2" placeholder="只写这个角色：角色标签、发色、瞳色、服装；hug / kiss 等双方互动请写到上方全局区" oninput="regionField(${i},'prompt',this.value)">${esc(r.prompt)}</textarea><div class="two" style="margin-top:4px"><div><div class="field-title"><span>区域</span></div><select id="regionPreset${i}" onchange="regionPresetChanged(${i})"><option value="left"${r.preset==='left'?' selected':''}>左侧（柔边）</option><option value="right"${r.preset==='right'?' selected':''}>右侧（柔边）</option><option value="top"${r.preset==='top'?' selected':''}>上侧（柔边）</option><option value="bottom"${r.preset==='bottom'?' selected':''}>下侧（柔边）</option><option value="custom"${r.preset==='custom'?' selected':''}>自定义</option></select></div><div><div class="field-title"><span>强度</span></div><input id="regionStrength${i}" type="number" min="0.75" max="1.5" step="0.05" value="${r.strength}" oninput="regionField(${i},'strength',this.value)"></div></div><div class="two" style="margin-top:4px"><div><div class="field-title"><span>X（左起点）</span></div><input id="regionX${i}" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="${Number(r.x.toFixed(3))}" oninput="regionField(${i},'x',this.value)"></div><div><div class="field-title"><span>Y（上起点）</span></div><input id="regionY${i}" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="${Number(r.y.toFixed(3))}" oninput="regionField(${i},'y',this.value)"></div></div><div class="two" style="margin-top:4px"><div><div class="field-title"><span>宽</span></div><input id="regionW${i}" type="number" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.01" value="${Number(r.width.toFixed(3))}" oninput="regionField(${i},'width',this.value)"></div><div><div class="field-title"><span>高</span></div><input id="regionH${i}" type="number" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.01" value="${Number(r.height.toFixed(3))}" oninput="regionField(${i},'height',this.value)"></div></div><div id="regionWarn${i}" class="small" style="color:#ffb4b4;margin-top:2px"></div></div>`).join('');updateRegionWarnings();toggleRegions()}
function toggleRegions(){const on=$('regionsEnabled').checked,panel=$('regionsPanel'),forcedGuidanceOff=on&&$('guidanceMode')?.value!=='off';if(panel){panel.setAttribute('aria-disabled',String(!on));panel.querySelectorAll('input,textarea,select').forEach(el=>el.disabled=!on)}if($('guidanceMode')){if(on)$('guidanceMode').value='off';$('guidanceMode').disabled=on||!currentSamplingProfile().guidance_supported;guidanceChanged(true);if(forcedGuidanceOff)$('status').textContent='多人分区已自动关闭 SAG/PAG，避免 Hook 重复计算和人物特征冲突。'}updateRegionWarnings()}
let img2imgUpload={name:'',previewUrl:''};
function toggleImg2img(){const on=$('img2imgEnabled').checked;$('img2imgControls').style.display=on?'block':'none'}
async function uploadImg2img(){const file=$('img2imgFile').files[0];if(!file)return;if(file.size>20*1024*1024){$('img2imgPreview').textContent='文件超过 20 MB，请换一张更小的底图。';return}$('img2imgPreview').textContent='正在上传底图…';try{const form=new FormData();form.append('pose',file,file.name);const response=await fetch('/api/upload-pose',{method:'POST',body:form}),data=await response.json();if(data.error)throw Error(data.error);if(img2imgUpload.previewUrl)URL.revokeObjectURL(img2imgUpload.previewUrl);img2imgUpload={name:data.name,previewUrl:URL.createObjectURL(file)};$('img2imgOutput').value='';$('img2imgPreview').innerHTML=`<img alt="底图预览" src="${img2imgUpload.previewUrl}" style="max-width:160px;max-height:160px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)">`;$('status').textContent='已选择上传的底图，启用整图重绘后生效。'}catch(e){$('img2imgPreview').textContent='底图上传失败：'+e.message}}
function selectImg2imgOutput(){const name=$('img2imgOutput').value;if(!name)return;$('img2imgFile').value='';if(img2imgUpload.previewUrl)URL.revokeObjectURL(img2imgUpload.previewUrl);img2imgUpload={name,previewUrl:''};$('img2imgPreview').innerHTML=`<img alt="底图预览" src="/output?name=${encodeURIComponent(name)}" style="max-width:160px;max-height:160px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)">`;$('status').textContent='已选择该输出图为底图，启用整图重绘后生效。'}
let pendingDerivationContext=null;
const PENDING_DERIVATION_OPERATIONS=['txt2img','seed_variant','img2img','inpaint','face_fix','hand_fix','upscale','outfit_change','scene_change','style_change','section_change'];
function normalizePendingDerivationContext(value){if(!value||typeof value!=='object')return null;const id=String(value.parentGenerationId||'').trim().toLowerCase(),artifact=String(value.parentArtifactId||'').trim().toLowerCase(),operation=String(value.operation||'').trim().toLowerCase();if(!/^[0-9a-f]{32}$/.test(id)||!PENDING_DERIVATION_OPERATIONS.includes(operation))return null;return{parentGenerationId:id,...(/^[0-9a-f]{32}$/.test(artifact)?{parentArtifactId:artifact}:{}),operation}}
function renderPendingDerivation(){const banner=$('pendingDerivation');if(!banner)return;const context=normalizePendingDerivationContext(pendingDerivationContext);banner.hidden=!context;if(context){const label=$('pendingDerivationText');if(label)label.textContent=`将从作品 ${context.parentGenerationId.slice(0,10)}… 派生（${context.operation}）；下一次生成会记录父子谱系。`}};
function setPendingDerivationContext(value){pendingGenerationSubmission=null;pendingDerivationContext=normalizePendingDerivationContext(value);renderPendingDerivation()}
function getPendingDerivationContext(){return pendingDerivationContext?{...pendingDerivationContext}:null}
function clearPendingDerivationContext(silent=false){pendingGenerationSubmission=null;if(!pendingDerivationContext)return;pendingDerivationContext=null;renderPendingDerivation();if(!silent)$('status').textContent='已取消派生关联；后续生成按普通任务提交。'}
function applyPendingDerivation(body,context=pendingDerivationContext){const safe=normalizePendingDerivationContext(context);if(!safe)return{...body};return{...body,parentGenerationId:safe.parentGenerationId,...(safe.parentArtifactId?{parentArtifactId:safe.parentArtifactId}:{}),operation:safe.operation}}
let jobQueue=[];const JOB_QUEUE_STORAGE='easyPanelJobQueueV2',MAX_LOGICAL_JOBS=50,MAX_QUEUED_IMAGES=200;
function queuedImageCount(jobs=jobQueue){return jobs.reduce((sum,job)=>sum+Math.max(1,Math.min(16,Number.parseInt(job.batchCount,10)||1)),0)}
function saveJobQueue(){try{sessionStorage.setItem(JOB_QUEUE_STORAGE,JSON.stringify(jobQueue))}catch{}}
function loadJobQueue(){try{const saved=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(JOB_QUEUE_STORAGE)||'[]');jobQueue=Array.isArray(saved)?saved.slice(0,MAX_LOGICAL_JOBS):[]}catch{jobQueue=[]}}
function jobSummary(job){const model=String(job.model||'').replace(/\\/g,'/').split('/').pop(),loras=(job.loras||[]).map(l=>String(l.name||'').replace(/\\/g,'/').split('/').pop()).join('、')||'无 LoRA',count=Math.max(1,Number.parseInt(job.batchCount,10)||1);return `${model} · ${job.width||'?'}×${job.height||'?'} · ${count} 张 · LoRA：${loras} · seed：${job.seed}`}
function renderJobQueue(){const box=$('jobQueueList'),images=queuedImageCount(),label=jobQueue.length?`${jobQueue.length}任务 / ${images}张`:'0';[$('jobQueueCount'),$('jobQueueDockCount')].forEach(count=>{if(count)count.textContent=label});$('jobQueueDockCount')?.closest('.dock-send')?.classList.toggle('has-jobs',jobQueue.length>0);if(!box)return;if(!jobQueue.length){box.textContent='队列为空：设置好模型 / LoRA / 提示词 / 尺寸 / 生成数量后点“＋ 加入任务队列”。';return}box.innerHTML=`<div style="margin-bottom:4px">已暂存 ${jobQueue.length} 个逻辑任务，共 ${images} 张（发送时按顺序执行）：</div>`+jobQueue.map((job,i)=>`<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;padding:2px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)"><span title="${esc(jobSummary(job))}" style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">${i+1}. ${esc(jobSummary(job))}</span><button class="secondary" type="button" style="padding:0 6px" onclick="removeJob(${i})">×</button></div>`).join('')}
function enqueueJob(){let job;const context=getPendingDerivationContext();try{job=applyPendingDerivation(payload(),context);job.batchCount=generationCount()}catch(e){$('status').textContent='加入队列失败：'+e.message;return}if(jobQueue.length>=MAX_LOGICAL_JOBS){$('status').textContent=`加入队列失败：最多 ${MAX_LOGICAL_JOBS} 个逻辑任务。`;return}if(queuedImageCount()+job.batchCount>MAX_QUEUED_IMAGES){$('status').textContent=`加入队列失败：展开后最多 ${MAX_QUEUED_IMAGES} 张，请先发送当前队列。`;return}jobQueue.push(job);if(context)clearPendingDerivationContext(true);saveJobQueue();renderJobQueue();$('status').textContent=`已加入第 ${jobQueue.length} 个任务（${job.batchCount} 张）${context?'，已保留派生关联':''}；当前共 ${queuedImageCount()} 张。`}
function removeJob(i){jobQueue.splice(i,1);saveJobQueue();renderJobQueue();$('status').textContent='已移除队列中的任务。'}
function clearJobQueue(){jobQueue=[];saveJobQueue();renderJobQueue();$('status').textContent='任务队列已清空。'}
async function sendJobQueue(){if(!jobQueue.length){$('status').textContent='任务队列为空，请先加入任务。';return}const jobs=jobQueue.map(job=>({...job})),expected=queuedImageCount(jobs);jobQueue=[];saveJobQueue();renderJobQueue();$('status').textContent=`已发送 ${jobs.length} 个逻辑任务（共 ${expected} 张）；生成期间仍可继续加入新任务。`;const btn=$('generate');btn.disabled=true;beginGenerationProgress(expected,'队列生成进度');$('result').classList.remove('gallery');$('result').textContent=`正在提交 ${jobs.length} 个逻辑任务，共 ${expected} 张…`;try{const r=await fetch('/api/generate-batch',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({jobs})}),d=await r.json();if(d.error)throw Error(d.error);const all=[],submitted=d.jobs||[];submitted.forEach(item=>registerGenerationPrompt(item.prompt_id));for(const item of submitted){selectGenerationPrompt(item.prompt_id);$('status').textContent=`任务 ${item.task_index+1}/${d.logical_tasks} · 第 ${item.image_index+1}/${item.image_count} 张 · 总进度 ${item.index+1}/${d.total_images}`;const output=await poll(item.prompt_id,60);output.forEach(image=>image.experimentLabel=item.label||'');await attachSnapshotOutputs(item.snapshot_id,output);all.push(...output);renderGeneratedImages(all)}renderGeneratedImages(all);$('status').textContent=`已发送队列完成：${d.logical_tasks} 个任务，共生成 ${all.length}/${d.total_images} 张；发送后新加入的队列任务仍保留，可继续发送。`;finishGenerationProgress(true,`队列完成：${d.logical_tasks} 个任务，共 ${all.length}/${d.total_images} 张。`);loadSnapshots()}catch(e){$('status').textContent='任务队列发送/等待失败：'+e.message+' 已提交到 ComfyUI 的任务仍会继续执行。';finishGenerationProgress(false,e.message)}finally{btn.disabled=false;queue()}}
function permutations(items){if(items.length<=1)return[items.slice()];const result=[];items.forEach((item,index)=>permutations(items.slice(0,index).concat(items.slice(index+1))).forEach(rest=>result.push([item,...rest])));return result}
function renderExperimentControls(){const mode=$('experimentMode')?.value||'order',wrap=$('experimentWeightControls'),select=$('experimentLora');if(wrap)wrap.style.display=mode==='weight'?'block':'none';if(select){const current=select.value,items=selectedLoraPayload();select.innerHTML=items.map((item,index)=>`<option value="${index}"${String(index)===current?' selected':''}>${index+1}. ${esc(String(item.name).replace(/\\/g,'/').split('/').pop())}</option>`).join('')}}
function strictExperimentJobs(base,mode,seeds){const original=base.loras.map(item=>({...item})),variants=[];if(mode==='order'){if(original.length<2)throw Error('顺序实验至少需要 2 个 LoRA。');if(original.length>4)throw Error('顺序实验最多支持 4 个 LoRA，避免排列数量超过任务队列上限。');permutations(original).forEach((loras,index)=>variants.push({label:`顺序 ${index+1}: `+loras.map(item=>String(item.name).replace(/\\/g,'/').split('/').pop()).join(' → '),loras}))}else{if(!original.length)throw Error('权重实验至少需要 1 个 LoRA。');const target=Math.max(0,Math.min(original.length-1,Number.parseInt($('experimentLora').value,10)||0)),weights=String($('experimentWeights').value||'').split(/[,，\s]+/).map(Number).filter(value=>Number.isFinite(value)&&value>=0&&value<=1.5).slice(0,8);if(!weights.length)throw Error('请填写 0–1.5 的有效权重。');weights.forEach(weight=>{const loras=original.map(item=>({...item}));loras[target].weight=weight.toFixed(2);variants.push({label:`${String(loras[target].name).replace(/\\/g,'/').split('/').pop()} 权重 ${weight.toFixed(2)}`,loras})})}const jobs=[];for(const variant of variants){for(let seedIndex=0;seedIndex<seeds;seedIndex++){const job=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(base));job.loras=variant.loras;job.batchCount=1;const seed=String(base.seed??'').trim();if(/^\d+$/.test(seed))try{job.seed=(BigInt(seed)+BigInt(seedIndex)).toString()}catch{}job.experiment={strict:true,mode,label:variant.label,baselineSeed:String(base.seed),seedIndex,lockedFields:['model','promptOverride','width','height','seed','steps','cfg','sampler','scheduler','enhancements']};jobs.push(job)}}return jobs}
async function createStrictExperiment(){try{const compiled=await compilePromptPreview();if(compiled.errors?.length)throw Error(compiled.errors.join('；'));const base=payload();base.promptOverride={enabled:true,positive:compiled.positive||'',negative:compiled.negative||''};const seed=String(base.seed??'').trim();if(!/^\d+$/.test(seed))throw Error('严格对比必须先填写固定的非负整数 seed。');const seeds=Math.max(1,Math.min(4,Number.parseInt($('experimentSeeds').value,10)||1)),mode=$('experimentMode').value,jobs=strictExperimentJobs(base,mode,seeds);if(jobQueue.length+jobs.length>MAX_LOGICAL_JOBS||queuedImageCount()+jobs.length>MAX_QUEUED_IMAGES)throw Error(`实验需要 ${jobs.length} 个任务，超过当前队列余量。`);jobQueue.push(...jobs);saveJobQueue();renderJobQueue();$('experimentInfo').textContent=`已冻结同一基线并加入 ${jobs.length} 个严格变体；仅 ${mode==='order'?'LoRA 顺序':'目标 LoRA 权重'}发生变化。`;$('status').textContent='严格对比实验已加入队列，确认后点击“发送队列”。'}catch(e){$('experimentInfo').textContent='创建失败：'+e.message}}
function snapshotTime(value){try{return new Date(Number(value)).toLocaleString()}catch{return''}}
